## The short version

**EduConnect is the main application.** It is the staff dashboard where classes, students,
teachers, attendance, the timetable, exams and fees all live. Almost everything in this guide is
about that one application.

The same application is sold under two names, depending on who it is deployed for:

- **EduConnect** — the deployment for schools.
- **KinderCare** — the deployment for kindergartens.

They are not separate products with separate features. They are the same codebase with different
wording, different defaults and a different set of screens switched on. A kindergarten does not get
a cut-down EduConnect; it gets EduConnect with the parts a kindergarten actually uses.

If a screen is described anywhere in the **EduConnect** section of this guide, assume it also
exists in a KinderCare deployment unless the KinderCare section says otherwise.

## The pieces around it

Four things sit alongside the staff dashboard:

| Piece | Who signs in | What it's for |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Staff dashboard** | Staff, teachers, admins | Everything operational — this is EduConnect proper |
| **Parent portal** | Parents | Attendance, progress reports, the handbook, paying fees |
| **Admissions portal** | Applicants, before they are students | Reading the prospectus, applying, paying the application fee |
| **KinderCare mobile apps** | Kindergarten staff and parents | The two phone apps described in the KinderCare section |

The two KinderCare mobile apps — a **staff app** and a **parent app** — only exist for kindergarten
deployments. Schools use the web parent portal instead.

## Why the wording changes between institutes

The dashboard reads its own vocabulary from the institute's settings, so the same button can say
"School" at one institute and "Kindergarten" at another. That is configuration, not a different
build. See [Why Terminology Changes Between Institutes](/docs/shared-institute-branding).

## Where to start

- New to the staff dashboard? [Finding Your Way Around](/docs/educonnect-navigating-the-dashboard).
- Setting up an institute from nothing? [Setting Up a New Institute](/docs/educonnect-setting-up-a-new-institute).
- A teacher? Go straight to [Your First Week as a Teacher](/docs/educonnect-teacher-getting-started).
